Full Eidolon & Warden Analysis

First Of All, What is Warden/Eidolon?

Ow2 has 2 layers

Layer 1 Eidolon ( Overwatch_Loader.dll ): Anti Tamper layer responsible for IAT encryption, HWID collection, code obfuscation, and integrity verification.
And its Acts as a loader/guard between the game executable and the Windows API.

Layer 2 Warden ( Overwatch.exe ) Runtime anti-cheat enforcement using Vectored Exception Handling (VEH), INT3 trampolines, timing checks, process enumeration, and integrity scanning modules.

Now, some finds

1-Overwatch.exe has Exactly ( One Import ) which "Overwatch_loader.dll!eidolon_run) 0 direct win32 imports
2-the HWID Decryption Key, Rotates every session, prevents offline decryption tho
3-all Warden Module names are Compared via Runtime Hash, no strings cross ref exit in code
4-the .eid section ( ig it was 4.2 mb ) stays Encrypted Event in Memory, Decrypted page by page on execution only
5-the IAT uses a Cryptographic trampoline where all 31 Dll Imports point to the same Dummy addr statically
6-Warden Module Scanning modules (FkCheck, VCheck, IntegrityCk) are ref via a hash table, not direct Lea


