Now, Arch Points

the critical insight, overwatch.exe has only one imports, which is just Overwatch_loader.dll!eidolon_run, every single Windows API Call goes through the loader dll encrypted IAT this means:

Hooking Overwatch.exe IAT is impossible ( there nothing to hook )
All Standard API monitors ( API Monitor, process monitor, in API Mode ) see nothing
the exe is a stub that delegates everything through the loader
any detour must either hook the loader resolved IAT or hook at syscall level



Now, Warden Native Anti Cheat

1- TLS Callbacks

3 TLS Callbacks execute before the Entry Point (eidolon_run)

TLS Callback 1: RVA: 0x02665714, PEB Anti Debug
TLS Callback 2: RVA: 0x02665BB0, VEH Registration
TLS Callback 3: RVA: 0x026BC5F0, Thread Env

What they do?

Callback 1: PEB Guard
checks BeingDebugged, flag at PEB + 0x2
Checks NtGlobalFlag at PEB + 0xBC ( should be 0 for non Debugged )
if Debugger Detected during TLS Phase, Calls RtlExitUserProcess Instantly
this means even attaching a debugger before the entrypoint will be caught, that explain why in cheat engine when u attach a Windows Debugger, game closes instantly.

Callback 2: VEH Setup
Calls RtlAddVectoredExceptionHandler to register Warden VEH Handler
Stores The Handler Handle in a Global Var, for later removal
The Handler is Registred as a First Chance VEH, not last chance VCH
first chance means Warden Get every exception before any Debugger

Callback 3: Thread Setup
Init Per Thread Anti Debug Structures
Sets up TLS Data for obfuscated Global Var Access
Installs Thread Local Exception Handlers


